      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha mībi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza līngī hangī ū Yesu akandya kūlanga ha ng'walo gwa nyanza. Ibita itaale lyūng'okalīīla, nose ūja mu nyanza ūūkigasha mu lyato; ī libita lya banhū pye a bangī lyūbiza ha ng'walo, a ha sī nyūmu henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbalanga mihayo mingī bo kūtūmamīla shigemeng'hejo; ū mu būlangi bokwe ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alidegelekagi; mībi akafuma, ūja kūbība mbīyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alībība jingī jūgwīla mu nzīla, jiza noni jūjilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingī jūgwīla mu sī ya mawe mawe, jūgehelwa ī sī ya kūjifukīīla, ahene jikangūha ū kūzwa īkī jalī jitafukīīlilwe chiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho lyaseba ī līīmi, lyūjoocha jūjiga, nguno jalī jitī na miji ya kwigela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingī jūgwīla mu ming'hwa, aho jilīkūla na a ming'hwa gūkūlanīja najo, gūjishiteleja; jūduuma ū kūtwaja a matwajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī jingī jikagwīla mu sī yawiza, jūzwa chiza jūkūla, jūtwaja matwajo, jimò makūmi adatū, jingī makūmi atandatū, na jingī igana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūhaya gīkī, “Ūyo alī na matū gakigwaga ni igwage.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nguno ya kūtūmamīla shigemeng'hejo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wasaaga iyene, abo baalī hihī nang'hwe, na a babo ikūmi na babīlī būmūja ī mihayo ya shigemeng'hejo shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla gīkī, “A bing'we ng'winhilwe ī mbisīla ja būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu. Alīyo ū kū ba hanze, pyī ī mihayo īlī mu shigemeng'hejo dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ībize gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Makūlū ga shigemeng'hejo sha mībi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu ongeja kūbawīla gīkī, “Mutūshiitegelejaga ī shigemeng'hejo shenīshi? Mukūshimana ginehe lūūlū pyī ī shigemeng'hejo ī shingī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mībi akabībaga mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo abo balī mu nzīla ūmo gūkabībagwa ū mhayo gwenūyo, balī abo bakamalaga ū kūgwigwa, hūna haho na haho wiza ū Shetani wagūpula ū mhayo ūyo gwabībagwa ū mung'holò jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangī balīho balī gītī sī ya mawe mawe, a benabo balī abo bakagwigwaga ū mhayo bagwanukūla wangū wangū na būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike gwikala gūtī na miji ū mubo, gwabagunanha ikanza iguhī dūhū, alīyo ūlū gilonga makoye, nūūlū būluhi kūlwa nguno yago ū mhayo, haho na haho bakagwaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balīho bangī balī gītī sī īzwile ming'hwa; a bene balī abo bakagwigwaga ū mhayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwike ī myatīla ya būlī lūshikū, nū būlemba lembi bo sabo, nū kwikūmva kwa būlī mbika, shikagūshitelejaga ū mhayo gwagaya a matwajo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bangī balī gītī sī yawiza; bakagwigwaga ū mhayo bagwanukūla, batwaja matwajo, bangī makūmi adatū, bangī makūmi atandatū, na bangī igana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha tala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla hangī gīkī, “Angū ī tala īkenhagwa gīkī īkundīkījiwe itangwa, nūūlū ītūūlwe ng'wizungu lya būlīīlī? Ītī gīkī ītūūlwe h'ikīndīkīlo lya tala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gūtīho mhayo ūyo gūkabisagwa ūlū ītī gīkī gūloolechiwe, nū yūyo gūkakundīkījiagwa ūlū ītī gīkī gūlakundūlīlwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū alī na matū gakigwaga ni igwage.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla hangī gīkī, “Ilang'hanagi nayo īyo mukūdegelekaga, ī ngelekelo īyo mukūgelekelaga, h'īyo mukūgelekelwa na a bing'we, nīyo hangī mukongejiwa na kūtinda ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na shikolo akwinhwa, ūyo atī na shikolo nī shisho alī nasho akūtaajiwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kakūlīle ka mbīyū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ū Yesu ūhaya, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būbizile gītī munhū ūyo akabībaga mbīyū ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wila olaala, wela hangī omisha, alīyo atūdūla ū kūmana ūmo jikazwīlaga nū mumo jikakūlīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī hū yene īkajinhaga kūtwaja matwajo; kwandīja idūūtū, hama lyangala, kūshisha kūpandīka mbeke ū mu lyangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a matwajo ūlū gakomeela, haho na haho akabītyaga mo lūshū, nguno gashikaga a magesa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha kabīyū ka haladali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ūhaya, “Ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu tūbūlenganīje na kī, nūūlū tūbūtūūle mu shigemeng'hejo kī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbange gītī kabīyū ka haladali ako kakahambagwa; a koyi kalī kado ba bado ū mu mbīyū pyī ī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū kūūzwa, kakakūlaga lyabiza Isaka itaale kūtinda pye ī mitī ya masaka. A matambī gakakūlaga kūshisha na noni ja kūlala japandīka wikalo ū mu mbeho yalyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ikanza ū mu kūbasomboolela, ū Yesu watūmamīlaga shigemeng'hejo shingī sha mbika yenīyī, kūlenganīla nū būdūla bo kwitegeleja kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī atabasomboolelaga mhayo ūlū ītī mu shigemeng'hejo, alīyo a bahemba bakwe waboolekejaga ūlū wasaaga nabo iyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlembeeja nyanza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyabiza lya mhīndī ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, ū Yesu ūbawīla a bahemba bakwe gīkī, “Tūjagi kū nkīlo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlīleka ī libita lya banhū bingīla nang'hwe mu lyato, būnjana gīt'ūmo walī; na mato gangī gūlondeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balīja gūbūūka nyaga ntaale, mahuuli gūyūlītūla ī lyato, nose lyegeela kokala minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei walī kū numa ya lyato alaalile tūlo, wisagūlaga ha nsago ū ntwe gokwe. Būmisha balīng'wīla, “Nangi nibūlī ūtūdīlīlaga alīyo tūlīhaya kūshila?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabūūka ūgūhama ū nyaga; nī nyanza wīwīla, “Lembeelaga ūhuumūle.” Na ng'hana gūlembeela ū nyaga, hūbiza sele sele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla, “Nibūlī ng'walī ng'ogohaga gīko? Mutaalī dūhū ū kūbiza na kūsanya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakogoha na kogohele kataale no, bandya kwiwīla boi bike balīhaya, “Ī gete ū munhū ng'wenūyū ni nani, wa kwigwiwa būyaga na miyaga na manyanza hose?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
